{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はサンクエトワールの1周年記念！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の10月4日に\n私たち5人のユニット名\nサンクエトワールという名前が決まりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがレギュラーを務める\nらじらー！さんで\nユニット名を募集する企画を開いてもらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんの応募の中から\n私たちで選びきまりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランス語で五つ星。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても素敵なユニット名です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人への近道"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵な曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVもあの時の私たちの精一杯がうつっていて\n3日に1回はみてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃の気持ちを忘れたくない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あの頃より成長してたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後、サンクエトワールで\nどうやって活動できるかわからないけど\n私たちから発信して\nもっとたくさん皆さんの前に\n出られるようにがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワール単体として\n強くなれたら\nきっともっと\nそれぞれ5人の星がもっと煇くと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/04/9114511/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/04/9114511/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/04/9114511/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/04/9114511/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたはね、あしたはね、\nとても楽しみなお仕事なの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるよ～～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だがしかし！\n今日は寝すぎちゃって\nぜーんぜん眠たくない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝、4時15分に起きるから\n起きれるか不安(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒おきるひとー？(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いないねー(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい(｡ρω-｡)ひとりでおきまーす(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目覚ましを止めるだけじゃなく\n止めたあとちゃんと起きれますよーに(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/04/9114511/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋っていいよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節の変わり目ってわくわくする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきうき～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキップしたい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきうき～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、最近白米が好きなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、白米食べてる時\nさゆりんご軍団の白米様が頭でなってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白米様かわいくてすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は何様がいいかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな食べ物多くて選べない(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お買い物したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のブログごちゃごちゃ！\nいつもごちゃごちゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝食\nおいしかったな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜ご飯でお刺身たべたの！\nサーモン！サーモンすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではきょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}